{
  "info": {
    "name": "Inference Services",
    "description": "Kino inference services: ASR (Parakeet TDT), OCR (PP-OCRv6 ONNX), Pipeline\nAll on GPU 0 (RTX 2070 SUPER)\n\nPorts:\n- 9360: ASR - onnxruntime-gpu, VAD chunking\n- 9361: OCR - onnxruntime-gpu, strip-based detection for tall images\n- 9355: Pipeline daemon\n\nOCR ?preview=true returns annotated image with bounding boxes + text.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
